msgctxt "196"
msgid "Hrf... Gwaugh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Looks like I win."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"Yeah... Ya got me. You're a real speed demon, ya know that?\r\n"
"Ain't surprisin' ya gave my brothers a run for their dough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"...Guess I should hand you that 100 grand. You can count it up in front of "
"me, if ya like."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "You got <Color:8>100,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Thanks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"You mind if I ask you somethin'? How in the hell'd you end\r\n"
"up gettin' to be such a tough bastard?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"Hmm... I guess I just hate to lose. So I do what it takes to come out on "
"top."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"Haha, I feel you, man! Despite my jawbreaker-like exterior,\r\n"
"I got a soft, candy-like shell underneath... so I hate\r\n"
"getting smacked around. This job's motivation, y'know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"Yeah, and speaking of motivation, I'm gonna catch you one of\r\n"
"these days! Better not skip leg day at the gym, you hear!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"Your physique better stay on point, or else we're gonna\r\n"
"run circles around ya! Now, come on boys! We got us some\r\n"
"trainin' to do!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "You got 5,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "*pant* *pant*"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid ""
"It's all in the name, baby! Ain't nobody quick enough to\r\n"
"catch up with these exquisitely sculpted legs!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"Don't know how a slowpoke like you got the best of my brothers. I reckon "
"they been slackin' on their trainin'."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid ""
"Well, I'm sure ya know the drill by now. You can come back\r\n"
"and challenge me any time. In fact, I look forward to it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "One more win for the Try Guys! Awwww yeeeeaaaah!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid ""
"Don't know how a slowpoke like you got the best of my brothers. I reckon "
"they been slackin' on their trainin'."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid ""
"Lose sight of the target and it's all over, buddy boy. Gotta\r\n"
"figure out which way I'm goin' ahead of time or you'll get\r\n"
"left in the dust."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid ""
"Well, I'm sure ya know the drill by now. You can come back\r\n"
"and challenge me any time. In fact, I look forward to it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid ""
"Our name's been soiled, for cryin' out loud! Don't at least\r\n"
"one of you chowderheads wanna do somethin' about it!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid ""
"You're pretty much the aniki of all aniki, so why don't you\r\n"
"take care of it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid ""
"Oh, I intend to. I'm just embarrassed that one man got the\r\n"
"best of you both⑬smackin' one and outrunnin' the other!\r\n"
"You two oughta be outright ashamed!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid ""
"That chump won't touch me next time, so you just leave him\r\n"
"to me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid ""
"You can't be serious. Didn't this same man knock you flat on\r\n"
"your ass, what, two years ago?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid "So what? You saying you can beat him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid ""
"That's exactly what I'm sayin'. It's the whole damn reason I\r\n"
"came to this filthy stink-town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid "Hey. What's going on here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid "You again...!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid ""
"So this is the legendary... the infamous... guy who beat the\r\n"
"first two Mr. Try brothers. Yeah... he sure looks the part."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid "And who are you supposed to be?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid ""
"I'm the slickest and snazziest of the trio.\r\n"
"They call me... \"Mr. Try and Catch Me.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "712"
msgid "Just how many of you are there...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "724"
msgid ""
"So here's the deal: I run through the streets of Kamurocho\r\n"
"and you chase after me. If you somehow manage to catch me,\r\n"
"I give you the prize money. That's the operation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "736"
msgid "So basically you run away from people for a living?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid ""
"Got a problem with it, bud? I'm quick as greased lightning\r\n"
"on the speedway, so don't underestimate me. Besides,\r\n"
"catchin' someone's a hell of a lot harder than runnin' away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "760"
msgid "It does sound like a challenge..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "772"
msgid ""
"Then why not give it a shot? All our pride's at stake here,\r\n"
"so I won't hesitate to leave you sulkin' and stranded."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "784"
msgid ""
"It'll cost you 10,000 yen up front. Catch me and I'll pay\r\n"
"you ten times your ante: 100,000 yen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "796"
msgid "But hey. I get it if you're quakin' in your loafers. Ain't a big deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "808"
msgid "100,000 yen is tempting..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "820"
msgid "All right. I'll take you on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid "Good. But first, I'll take your 10 grand. I trust that won't be a problem?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "856"
msgid "Not at all. I'll be seeing that money with interest soon enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "868"
msgid "You paid <Color:8>10,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "880"
msgid ""
"Hah, I like that confidence. Okay then. I'll be runnin' through the streets "
"of this here city, and if ya can catch me before time runs out, that 100 "
"grand's all yours."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "892"
msgid ""
"Think ya can run like the wind? Catch up with a mirage?\r\n"
"Then you better move your ass, 'cause I'm gone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "916"
msgid "...Ah. Looks like I'm a little short on cash."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "928"
msgid ""
"What're you, a fuckin' bum? You tell me this now, after building up all "
"that hype?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "940"
msgid "Fine.. Go scrape up 10,000 yen and come back. I'll be waitin' right here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "952"
msgid "Sure..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "976"
msgid "Sorry... Maybe some other time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "988"
msgid "Oh, so you're a coward, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1000"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1012"
msgid ""
"I wanted to settle this once and for all... for me and my\r\n"
"brothers. But you just can't let that happen, can ya?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1060"
msgid "Back for more, tough guy? I'm just gonna make you eat dust again..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1072"
msgid ""
"Back again, tough guy? Ya finally got the balls to chase after a total "
"stranger? Well ain't that fine and dandy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1084"
msgid ""
"It'll be 10,000 yen up front. Catch me before the time\r\n"
"runs out, and I'll shell out 100 grand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1096"
msgid "So how about it? Wanna give it a go?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1108"
msgid "You'll really give me 100,000 yen if I catch you...?"
msgstr ""

